                <h1 class="mt-5 text-[32px] md:text-[46px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[0.95]">Kikoff Review 2026: The $0 Starter Revolving Tradeline</h1>
                <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] md:text-[18px] leading-7 text-slate-600 max-w-[680px]">Kikoff offers a no-credit-check revolving line starting at $0/month for credit building. We break down how it actually reports, when $5/mo Premium makes sense, and why revolving mix matters for thin files in the US.</p>

                <!-- Author Box -->
