                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">•</span>
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-bold">Reviewed by Dr. James L., CFA</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">E-E-A-T Reviewer</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-500">Updated Oct 20, 2026 • Sources: <a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/" class="underline">CFPB</a>, <a href="https://www.experian.com/" class="underline">Experian</a>, <a href="https://www.equifax.com/" class="underline">Equifax</a> • US focus. ScoreUp is not a credit bureau. Educational only.</p>
