                        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span><span><b>Need revolving mix:</b> FICO® Score mix is 10% of score. If you only have Self (installment), Kikoff adds revolving.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span><span><b>Zero to $5/mo budget:</b> Basic is truly $0/mo, Premium $5/mo adds higher line ($1,500) + VantageScore tracking.</span></li>
